  "description": "Known for loving nothing but pretty faces, Kang Ji-Heon never imagined falling for someone he couldn’t recognize. When he drunkenly confesses to an unknown junior, Ji-Heon insists it was a mistake, only to be undone by Kwon Jeong-Hae’s sincere tears. What starts as a reluctant relationship soon blurs into something genuine. \n\nWas it really just a misunderstanding… or the beginning of a love neither of them expected?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
